cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Stereofold in your research, please cite it as below, and cite Mol* as well."
title: "Stereofold"
version: 0.1.22
abstract: >-
  An MCP plugin, built on Mol*, that lets an AI agent put a protein structure
  on a Meta Quest or Apple Vision Pro over private Wi-Fi and change it on
  request. It opens public PDB entries or mmCIF coordinates in an interactive
  inspector that links sequence positions to 3D selections, and a separate
  desktop viewer renders slow rock, parallel, cross-eyed, and red-cyan
  anaglyph stereo. It is built for Claude Code, Claude Science, the Codex CLI,
  and the Codex app.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Stereofold Contributors"
